<BaseLayout
  title="Corn, Wine, and Oil — American Idolatry | Nazaryah"
  description="The cornerstones of the White House, the Capitol, and the Washington Monument were laid in Masonic rite and consecrated with corn, wine, and oil — the three gifts Hosea 2:8 says Israel prepared for Baal."
